# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
# One glob, not a list: the list outlived two of its entries (.venv-tts, .venv-f5tts) and kept
# them looking current. Live venvs are named in SETUP.md, which is the place to look.
.venv*/
venv/
hf_home/
*.egg-info/
.pytest_cache/

# Models and weights
models/
*.pt
*.pth
*.onnx
*.safetensors
*.bin

# The batch queue: hand-authored INPUT, rewritten every session, never repo content. Kept at the
# repo root rather than moved under work/ deliberately — work/ is the disk-cleanup zone (it has
# already lost baselines to one sweep), and a queue file living there is a queue file that a
# future 3am cleanup deletes.
/queue.txt

# Media and work artifacts
work/
work-exp/
# TTS audition sandbox + its generated per-voice configs (2026-07-19)
work-silero-v5/
cfg-silero-v5/
output/
# personal-use voice audition page (repo policy: person-agnostic docs, PD samples only)
bakeoff/narrators_personal.html
*.mp4
*.mkv
*.webm
*.wav
*.mp3
*.m4a
*.srt

